f=g?"":'"place": string or null, "placeWhen": "arrive" or "leave" or null, '
e=a9?'- A meeting or appointment at a time is "event".':'- Never use "event": the person puts things on their calendar by starting with the word "calendar". A meeting or appointment at a time is a "task" with that date and time.'
